<div class="container"><h1>巨锹甲虫 (Giant Stag Beetle)</h1>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th class="col-1">资料栏位</th><th class="col-data">巨锹甲虫<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:13px;">大型虫类</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
